{%- comment -%}
  The fixed home-delivery rate of one national delivery profile, in agorot, from the theme setting
  settings.shipping_profile_rates ("148825440625:115,148930593137:49,148971520369:115": the profile's id, a colon, the
  rate in shekels, comma separated; Cart › משלוח בסיכום העגלה). Prints nothing when the profile is not listed, so a
  caller can tell an unknown profile from a free one.

  The id is the one the dashboard writes into the variant metafield shipping.profile when it moves products into a
  profile other than the default (services/shipping-marks in joyMobile-Online-Dashboard).

  @param {string} profile - the profile's id (variant.metafields.shipping.profile).

  Output: an integer (agorot), or nothing.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign spr_id = profile | strip
  if spr_id != blank
    assign spr_pairs = settings.shipping_profile_rates | default: '' | split: ','
    for spr_pair in spr_pairs
      assign spr_parts = spr_pair | split: ':'
      if spr_parts.size == 2
        assign spr_key = spr_parts[0] | strip
        if spr_key == spr_id
          assign spr_value = spr_parts[1] | strip | times: 100 | round
          echo spr_value
          break
        endif
      endif
    endfor
  endif
-%}
